and selectable signal interfaces, the instrument supports gas-flow monitoring in petrochemical, power generation and metallurgical processes.",false,{"_57":247,"_222":-5,"_216":113,"_146":-5,"_143":248},"industrial",{"_103":113,"_146":-5,"_148":-5,"_149":150},{"_159":250,"_139":171,"_172":251,"_174":252,"_176":253,"_178":254,"_180":255,"_182":256,"_184":257,"_186":258,"_188":259},"287d31f2-573d-40b0-8a95-78fa8fb30365","2025040855196033.jpg","image/png",118746,"7f449f38ed6bf8e134b99b22ebc9fa0c38477f3744c6a59cd166d471f92c6feb",255,555,"/igenu-preview/media/7f449f38ed6bf8e134b99b22.png","2026-10-20T17:32:39.741Z",[260],{"_180":255,"_182":256,"_174":193,"_184":261},"/igenu-preview/media/e43bee78aa0a1ae068fb4bf4.webp",{"_159":209,"_57":263,"_214":264,"_216":265,"_218":266,"_220":245,"_162":267,"_224":269},"ig8100mp","IG8100MP","IG8100MP Portable Gas Detector and Alarm","A portable gas detector with pumped sampling and sensor options selected for the target gases. A color display presents measurement information, while audible, visual and vibration alarms support on-site awareness during mobile gas monitoring and inspection work.",{"_57":163,"_222":-5,"_216":116,"_146":-5,"_143":268},{"_103":116,"_146":-5,"_148":-5,"_149":150},{"_159":270,"_139":171,"_172":271,"_174":252,"_176":272,"_178":273,"_180":274,"_182":275,"_184":276,"_186":277,"_188":278},"2c4a4ac6-d50b-4737-b7e4-ebc32635cd6c","2025040852237053.png",280168,"08e61223b82894782eed918587b2b8ae3b4fa6fbbb2b5228bbfebeca395a748a",691,699,"/igenu-preview/media/08e61223b82894782eed9185.png","2026-10-20T17:32:39.713Z",[279,282,285],{"_180":191,"_182":280,"_174":193,"_184":281},324,"/igenu-preview/media/5f86a27572b4892ac922fa01.webp",{"_180":196,"_182":283,"_174":193,"_184":284},647,"/igenu-preview/media/56eed4aed7ff6130c91bdc9f.webp",{"_180":274,"_182":275,"_174":193,"_184":286},"/igenu-preview/media/50e8b14977630a4f3e555596.webp",{"_159":210,"_57":288,"_214":289,"_216":290,"_218":291,"_220":245,"_162":292,"_224":294},"ig8300voc","IG8300VOC","IG8300VOC Online Odor and Gas Monitoring System","Monitor configured odor-related gases through a multisensor system with sample pretreatment, temperature compensation and automatic calibration functions. An integrated display, data storage and communication options support connected environmental monitoring at wastewater treatment, chemical production and waste-handling sites.",{"_57":163,"_222":-5,"_216":116,"_146":-5,"_143":293},{"_103":116,"_146":-5,"_148":-5,"_149":150},{"_159":295,"_139":171,"_172":296,"_174":175,"_176":297,"_178":298,"_180":299,"_182":300,"_184":301,"_186":302,"_188":303},"248b037a-97ca-43b1-abac-a26d2deaf089","2025040852682581.png",22439,"97c97b1129c8237eb4b7d324799035ec948f856036b41f67613d22e0171553b0",194,421,"/igenu-preview/media/97c97b1129c8237eb4b7d324.jpg","2026-10-20T17:32:39.720Z",[304],{"_180":299,"_182":300,"_174":193,"_184":305},"/igenu-preview/media/51378fe539ff38c9e791e3c9.webp","sourceSections",[308],{"_159":309,"_310":311,"_7":312,"_327":-5,"_328":329},"1e97c3f8-1a3f-469f-8ead-51ebcc229cd7","type","TEXT_IMAGE",{"_313":38,"_314":164,"_166":38,"_315":316,"_325":326},"body","heading","sourceNotes",[317],{"_103":318,"_319":150,"_166":320,"_321":322,"_323":324},"HARMFUL/FLAMMABLE GAS","pending","<p>HARMFUL/FLAMMABLE GAS :</p><p>Three basic kinds of hazards</p><p>Oxygen (deficiency and enrichment)</p><p>Flammable gases and vapors</p><p>Toxic contaminants</p><p>OSHA Has Determined Asphyxiation to Be the Leading Cause of Death in Confined Spaces. Air is oxygen deficient whenever concentration is less than 19.5% O2.</p><p>Poisoning</p><p>As an LEL sensor become poisoned the sensors surface and the sensors pores will be coated with oxidized silicone.</p><p>A silicone poisoned sensor will first loose its ability to detect methane, while not exhibiting any noticeable inhibition to detect other combustible gases .</p><p>As poisoning progresses the the LEL sensor will eventually lose is ability to detect any combustible gases.</p><p>Biosystems Toxic Gas Sensors</p><p>Carbon monoxide (CO)</p><p>Hydrogen sulfide (H2S)</p><p>Combination sensors are available</p><p>Sulfur dioxide (SO2)</p><p>Chlorine (Cl2)/chlorine dioxide (ClO2)</p><p>Ammonia (NH3)</p><p>Phosphine (PH3)</p><p>Nitrogen dioxide (NO2)</p><p>Hydrogen cyanide (HCN)</p><p>Nitric oxide (NO)</p>","sourceUrl","http://www.igenu.com/index_2.html","capturedAt","2026-10-21T04:13:22.254Z","imagePosition","right","media","mediaItems",[]]
